    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Jeff Brohman",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106965949012170810938/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUtb0mK_YHQ9eox9JXhJCXcAV2My4HqV5iV7lkV7Bt19qtPjIcz=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Eric Boisclair was absolutely amazing at taking me through this process from start to finish. Eric had all the answers to the questions that I had, made some great recommendations and did not push anything onto me. Everyone that I met along the way (sales, finance, secretaries) were kind and helpful. Best car-buying experience that I’ve ever had!",
        "time": 1762193721,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ralph Saleh",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108594955189219740343/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ8E7vE9LCBHihnfsqBTySR9_7lGyz8SOtxLTS566gL-5IBAQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Mazda 220 offers the best, truly unmatchable service. The team consistently goes above and beyond for their customers, and it really shows. A special mention to Alex, who is exceptional — professional, friendly, and always willing to go the extra mile. You simply won’t find service like this anywhere else. Highly recommended!",
        "time": 1763501028,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ann Noseworthy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114211835087019281383/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKVFKu0fpyH5Al6jemhyQ72j-2LCSFKb8vMll2in9gtMwagbQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I have being driving a Mazda CX-5 for at least a dozen years and have been to several dealerships for service. This one is the best I have encountered. Suzie and Guylaine at the service counter are top notch in professionalism and customer service. Always helpful, always smiling. Thank you!!",
        "time": 1762966018,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Charles Fisher",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104672563305135134593/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK4DbpyOl-GArfQBaALFAg6UmL7EmEOa88fK8mCRn7_BbDdFg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "On a rainy gray Monday morning I went in to see if I could find a car for my daughter and was greeted by Isaac Salum. I have bought over 20 cars in my lifetime and none were as pleasurable as this one. No fast talking B.S , no constant upselling , no confusing play with the numbers , just the facts. More than once did he go out of his way to answer ANY question or concern I had. This salesman is a man of integrity, and I highly encourage you to seek him out for your next purchase. Well done to Mazda 2-20 from the beginning to end.",
        "time": 1763504238,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Stephanie Prihoda",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101249150424881577182/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWU9ATehMPdRrlBjX4_13ndqckswfdIzq6Zy6fTrdO1qELOBBc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Thank you Joey for your amazing customer service, care and help through out our process of buying a car with Mazda 220. Such a helpful, knowledgeable and kind representative to work with, he truly made the experience a 10/10 and was there every step of the way to help guide us!",
        "time": 1764103217,
